From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emmanuel Varagnat <emmanuel.varagnat@vates.tech>
Date: Fri, 13 Feb 2026 14:26:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] tapdisk: add support for LTTng tracepoints

Useful to get some insight on latencies.
See README-lttng.md on how to use it.

Signed-off-by: Emmanuel Varagnat <emmanuel.varagnat@vates.tech>
